	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1201_swrival_02_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しかも　こちらには
パスワードを　いれる　そうち……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:57:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:53:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>しかも　こちらには
パスワードを　いれる　そうち……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:57:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:53:31" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・Whitek2ver
・アジト船：2回目
・入力装置前に移動してメッセージ
・続けてswrival_02_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:58:23" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:53:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1201_swrival_02_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ということはだ▼
パスワードを　さがすか　ききだして
バリアを　けすしかないか▼
[Name:TrainerName ]！　てわけして
パスワードを　さがすぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:15:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:57:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ということはだ▼
パスワードを　探すか　ききだして
バリアを　解除しないとな▼
[Name:TrainerName ]　手分けして
パスワードを　探すぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:15:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:57:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・Whitek2ver
・アジト船：2回目
・主人公を向いてメッセージ表示
　メッセージ表示後、ライバル退場
　ライバルが画面外に消えると
　主人公操作可能に
・0＝主人公名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:57:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T11:57:26" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1201_pass_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうちが　ある……▼
パスワードを　いれるみたいだが
カードキーが　ひつよう　そうだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:09:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T07:01:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>装置が　ある……▼
パスワードを　入力するみたいだが
カードキーが　必要そうだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:09:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T07:01:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イベント：船首楼
・White2ver
・カードキー（仮）を持っていない</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:08:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>入力端末</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T07:01:01" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1201_pass_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうちが　ある……
パスワードを　いれるみたいだ▼
パスワードを　いれますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:08:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:08:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>装置が　ある……
パスワードを　入力するみたいだ▼
パスワードを　入力しますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:08:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:08:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イベント：船首楼
・White2ver
・カードキーを持っている
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→入力画面へ
　いいえ→終了
・パスワード関連は
　hide_ship_passwordで</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:09:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>入力端末</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T09:08:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1201_pass_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>その　パスワードは
まちがって　います</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T12:44:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T12:44:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>その　パスワードは
間違って　います</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T12:44:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T12:44:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イベント：船首楼
・White2ver
・カードキーを持っている
・入力ワードが不正解</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T12:44:27" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>入力端末</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T12:44:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
